WEBVTT

00:10:28.123 --> 00:10:31.168
What I've learned
in this journey of my own

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:33.295
and in talking to others
about their losses,

00:10:33.295 --> 00:10:37.716
is that Gracenotes create
the sense of completeness,

00:10:37.758 --> 00:10:39.927
contentedness and calm.

00:10:41.804 --> 00:10:44.723
I vividly recall the last night
my dad was alive.

00:10:45.849 --> 00:10:49.353
By then he was unconscious,
and everyone else had gone to bed.

00:10:50.062 --> 00:10:54.024
I sat with him
with my hand softly on his.

00:10:54.775 --> 00:10:58.195
And on this unrepeatable night,

00:10:58.237 --> 00:11:01.699
I didn't have to worry
about trying to find the words